Attribute.notes:
[DE_ATTR_COMMENT[
Der Name ist wie im Handelsregister eingetragen aufzuführen.
]DE_ATTR_COMMENT]
[EN_ATTR_COMMENT[
**The name must be entered as entered in the commercial register.
]EN_ATTR_COMMENT]

[DE_ATTR_COMMENT[
Nur wenn das Land noch in Landesteile unterteilt ist.
]DE_ATTR_COMMENT]
[EN_ATTR_COMMENT[
**Only if the country is still divided into parts.
]EN_ATTR_COMMENT]

[DE_ATTR_COMMENT[
Hierarchie der Accounts. Bsp: Trade Organization (Key Account), Party, Customer/Debitor (System MS CRM = Debtor), Prospect
]DE_ATTR_COMMENT]
[EN_ATTR_COMMENT[
**Hierarchy of accounts. Example Trade Organization (Key Account), Party, Customer/Debitor (System MS CRM = Debtor), Prospect
]EN_ATTR_COMMENT]

[DE_ATTR_COMMENT[
Responsible; zuständiger Point of Sales. Verkäufer welcher die Daten zu pflegen hat. Kundenkontakt. 
]DE_ATTR_COMMENT]
[EN_ATTR_COMMENT[
**Responsible; responsible point of sales. Seller who has to maintain the data. Customer contact
]EN_ATTR_COMMENT]

[DE_ATTR_COMMENT[
Auf Land geschlüsselt. Owner aus Land X kann nur Accounts aus Land X sehen. 
]DE_ATTR_COMMENT]
[EN_ATTR_COMMENT[
**Classified by land. Owner from country X can only see accounts from country X
]EN_ATTR_COMMENT]
